ulation.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical comparisons between percentages were made using two sample t-tests as appropriate for complex survey designs such as BRFSS.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Death rates were compared using a z-test when counts were >100.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Monte Carlo simulation was employed as a third method of assessing rate differences.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical comparisons between national and state estimates were made by removing the state’s estimate from the national estimate to account for nonindependence.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}